{
  "name": "Create CRM contacts from a form webhook and skip duplicates",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "main",
      "name": "Sticky Note main",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -656,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Create CRM contacts from a form webhook and skip duplicates\n\n### How it works\n\n1. Receives the form submission on a webhook.\n2. Normalizes the incoming fields first, trimming whitespace and lower-casing the email.\n3. Compares the normalized value against everything seen before with Remove Duplicates, which keeps state across executions.\n4. Creates a CRM contact only for a value that is genuinely new.\n5. Answers the form on both paths, so a repeat submission returns normally instead of hanging.\n\n### Setup steps\n\n- [ ] Copy the webhook production URL into your form's action or webhook setting.\n- [ ] Adjust the Set node to the field names your form actually sends.\n- [ ] Point the CRM node at your CRM's API and attach its credential.\n- [ ] Submit the form twice with the same email and confirm only one contact is created.\n\n### Customization\n\nDeduplicate on a different field, or on a combination of fields, by changing the value Remove Duplicates compares. Add a Slack or email node after the CRM call to be told about new leads.",
        "height": 848,
        "width": 480
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "g0",
      "name": "Sticky Note g0",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -96,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Receive and normalize submission\n\nNormalizing before deduplicating is the point: raw input makes Ann@Example.com and ann@example.com look like two different people.",
        "height": 288,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "g1",
      "name": "Sticky Note g1",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        800,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Skip anything seen before\n\nRemove Duplicates keeps state across executions, so a repeat submission is recognised days later.",
        "height": 384,
        "width": 240,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "g2",
      "name": "Sticky Note g2",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1232,
        160
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Create contact and respond\n\nOnly genuinely new values reach the CRM, and the form gets an answer either way.",
        "height": 288,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "contact-form",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "1f121978-e9dc-4df4-bacf-448a68fd00f6",
      "name": "When Form Submitted",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        -40,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "1c2a2f5a-39e5-4a4d-bec0-edce2737682e",
              "name": "email",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.email.toLowerCase().trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "56a57424-7d01-488c-9a57-57de79218d78",
              "name": "name",
              "value": "={{ $json.body.name.trim() }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "67ad2084-8167-4b89-b95d-a177ac4ff02e",
      "name": "Build Normalized Contact",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        400,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "removeItemsSeenInPreviousExecutions",
        "dedupeValue": "={{ $json.email }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "d9667def-bfa0-410d-8db3-0d30d5a5e5fb",
      "name": "Deduplicate by Email",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.removeDuplicates",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        840,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "https://api.your-crm.example/v1/contacts",
        "sendBody": true,
        "specifyBody": "json",
        "jsonBody": "={{ { \"email\": $json.email, \"name\": $json.name } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "10eb8bac-65e6-48c0-9c15-1ebf57ac8b5d",
      "name": "Create Contact in CRM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [
        1280,
        300
      ]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ { \"status\": \"received\" } }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "00fd6387-ee52-46f3-9d53-ad09273df76c",
      "name": "Respond With Success",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1720,
        300
      ]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "When Form Submitted": {
      "main": [
